│╭─Keys───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮│
││ j      down                   n         next unread        h/1 tree pane   ││
││ k      up                     N         previous unread    l/2 diff pane   ││
││ g      top                    }/{       hunk               s   reload      ││
││ G      bottom                 tab       next file          b   change base ││
││ ctrl+d diff half page down    shift+tab previous file      C   note        ││
││ ctrl+u diff half page up      r         mark read          ?   help        ││
││ ]/[    comment                R         mark file          q   quit        ││
││ z      place cursor: z/t/b    u/U       unmark                             ││
├│ v      select lines           c         comment                            ││
││ space  fold comment           x         resolve comment                    ││
││ enter  go to its line         e/D       edit, delete                       ││
